  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/239) by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHi, the built-in profiles \\(Neutral\\) and \\(Default\\) found under the Profiles drop-down menu are nearly identical, the default one activates only the lens correction module. Wouldn’t it be better when default applies an exposure curve as well, eg. film-like?\n",
